OL,3,GNEWSATractor run raises #1,000 in
OL,4,Amemory of farmer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tractor run has been held to raise
OL,7,Fmoney for a dialysis unit in memory of
OL,8,Fa farmer who died with kidney disease.
OL,10,FThe run in tribute to John Warne raised
OL,11,Fmore than #1,000 for the renal unit at
OL,12,FRoyal Cornwall Hospital, Truro. Warne
OL,13,Fdied on New Year's Day 2026 aged 52.
OL,15,FThe 33-mile journey involved 40
OL,16,Ftractors of all shapes and sizes,
OL,17,Fdriven by friends and family on 13
OL,18,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
